```
Patient has been taking Levetiracetam 500 mg twice daily for the past 6 months. The patient's seizures have not been well-controlled with this medication, so the doctor has added Onfi (cannabidiol) 20 mg twice daily. The patient has a history of temporal lobe epilepsy and has undergone a left temporal lobectomy 2 years ago.
```
